  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Returned Tajik Migrants: Promoting a Multi-Stakeholder Response to Mental Health and Disability Issues</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to improved access to services for returning Tajik migrants with psychosocial and mental health issues and disabilities. The project will enable an assessment on the health, social protection and gender-specific needs of returned migrants with psychosocial and mental health issues and disabilities; capacity building and advocacy activities targeted for the national government, civil society and private sector stakeholders; and support multilateral cooperation with countries of destination to identify potential areas of cooperation and establish a plan of action for future collaboration.</narrative>
  </description>
